@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Question answering in a RAG assistant with a chunked index
actor User
participant "RAG service" as App
participant "Chunker" as Ch
participant "BM25 retriever" as R
database "Chunk index" as Idx
participant "LLM" as LLM
== Offline indexing ==
App -> Ch : documents, size, overlap
Ch --> App : chunks
App -> R : fit(chunks)
R -> Idx : store BM25 weights
== Online question ==
User -> App : question
App -> R : search(question, k)
R -> Idx : score chunks
Idx --> R : top-k chunk ids
R --> App : k chunks (k x size words)
note right of App
  Context budget B words:
  k = floor(B / chunk size)
end note
App -> LLM : prompt = instructions + k chunks + question
LLM --> App : answer with citations
App --> User : answer + source chunks
@enduml
